{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squavity is a mind-bending, gravity-flipping <strong>precision platformer</strong>. Navigate through <strong>9 brutal levels</strong>\u00a0and a final boss fight, using your ability to flip gravity to overcome obstacles, evade traps, and unlock secrets hidden within a dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.poster.avif?t=1757699760\" width=848 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.webm?t=1757699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.mp4?t=1757699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Gravity Control:</strong> Master a core mechanic that's easy to understand but difficult to master. Every flip is a high-stakes decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Challenges:</strong> Conquer <strong>9 unforgiving levels</strong> packed with unique deadly traps and intricate designs, leading up to an ultimate boss fight that will push your skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Hunt &amp; Character Unlocks:</strong> Collect gold pieces scattered throughout the levels to unlock new characters and personalize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your skills and defy physics?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989490?t=1757699760","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989490?t=1757699760","capsule_im